### Dowloan and install ###
1. Visual studio code 
2. python
3. Set up pip 
python -m pip install --upgrade pip
4. Install robotframework , openpyxl , panas , numpy 
py -m pip install robotframework==7.5 openpyxl==3.1.5 pandas==3.0.5 numpy==2.5.1

### Check version ###

1. Check python version
py --version
2. Check pip version 
py -m pip --version
3. Robot Framework Version
py -m robot --version
4. Library Versions
py -m pip show openpyxl pandas numpy
